sequenceDiagram
    participant App as App<br>[implements GapCentralResponse]
    participant Node as Node<br>[implements GapCentral]

    Note over App, Node: Allowed states: standby.<br>Fire-and-forget, no response callback.<br>Should be called once during initialization<br>before any pairing takes place.

    App->>Node: GapCentral.SetIoCapabilities(displayYesNo)

    Note over App: Selected capability drives<br>the pairing method during PairAndBond<br>(Just Works, Passkey Entry,<br>or Numeric Comparison).
